~ start
Book: A new day has started.
%19 Book: You get the choice to send somebody on an expedition. Which kind of expedition do you want to do?
% 
	Book: You had to stay at home because of a storm.
	=> END
%3
	Book: There is a sabretooth at your front door.
	=> sabretooth
	
	
	
	
	
	
	~ sabretooth
	- Attack him with a Spear
	if Global.spear >= 1
		Book: You successfully protected the cave and made him run away. Your spear broke during the fight.
		do Global.spear -= 1
		=> END
	else
		Book: You did not have a spear.
		
		% 
			Book: He did not seem to be bothered by you and he walked away.
		% 
			Book: You could not defend yourself against him, and the sabretooth consumed everybody.
			do Global.is_run_over = true
		=> END

- hunting expedition
	%
		Book: You found a mammoth. 
		=> mammoth
	%
		Book: You found a hog. 
		=> hog
	%
		Book: You found a vulture. 
		=> vulture
		
		
	~ mammoth
	- Chase it
		if Global.spear >= 1
			%
				Book: You got 12 Meat and 6 leather.
				do Global.meat += 12
				do Global.leather += 6
				do Global.spear -= 1
				=> END
			%
				Book: You injured yourself, but got 6 leather and 12 Meat.
				do Global.meat += 12
				do Global.leather += 8
				do Global.spear -= 1
				do Global.health -=15
				=> END
		else
			Book: You did not have a spear.
			Book: It ran away.
			=> END
			
	- Dont chase it
		Book: It ran away.
		
		
	~ hog
	- Chase it
		if Global.spear >= 1
			%
				Book: You got 8 Meat and 4 leather.
				do Global.meat += 8
				do Global.leather += 4
				do Global.spear -= 1
				=> END
			%
				Book: You injured yourself, but got 4 leather and 8 Meat.
				do Global.meat += 8
				do Global.leather += 4
				do Global.spear -= 1
				do Global.health -=15
				=> END
		else
			Book: You did not have a spear.
			Book: It ran away.
			=> END
			
	- Dont chase it
		Book: It ran away.
		
		
	~ vulture
	- Chase it
		if Global.spear >= 1
			%
				Book: You got 4 Meat and 2 leather.
				do Global.meat += 4
				do Global.leather += 2
				do Global.spear -= 1
				=> END
			%
				Book: You injured yourself, but got 2 leather and 4 Meat.
				do Global.meat += 4
				do Global.leather += 2
				do Global.spear -= 1
				do Global.health -=15
				=> END
		else
			Book: You did not have a spear.
			Book: It ran away.
			=> END
			
	- Dont chase it
		Book: It ran away.









- gathering expedition
	%
		Book: You found berries.
		=> berries
	%
		Book: You found some herbs.
		=> herbs
	%
		Book: You found some sharp stones.
		=> stones
	%
		Book: You found some big leaves. You take them and return home.
		=> leaves
	%
		Book: You didn't find anything and went back home empty-handed.
		=> END
	~ berries
	- take them
		%4 
			Book: You took the berries.
			do Global.meat += 2
		% Book: You took the berries, but you got injured in the process. 
		
	- let them be
		Book: You left the berries and venture home.
	=> END
	
	
	~ herbs
	- take them
		%4 
			Book: You took the herbs.
			do Global.herbs += 4
		% Book: You took the herbs, but you got injured in the process. 
		
	- let them be
		Book: You left the herbs and venture home.
	=> END
	
	
	~ stones
	- take them
		%4 
			Book: You took the stones.
			do Global.stone += 3
		% Book: You took the stones, but you got injured in the process. 
		
	- let them be
		Book: You left the stones and venture home.
	~ leaves

=> END